{"3503790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PROHIBEAST", "steam_appid": 3503790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4464210], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prohibeast – Tactical Infiltration at the Heart of Prohibition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Prohibeast</i></strong>, a real-time tactical infiltration game, dive into a corruption-ridden <strong>1930s Chicago</strong> plagued by smuggling and black-market meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As meat consumption is outlawed, Al Capone expands his criminal empire</strong> through a ruthless black market. Faced with widespread corruption, <strong>Eliot Ness and his team of Untouchables are ready to strike from the shadows to bring down the mob from within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltration and Strategy: Make Your Mark with Your Own Style</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/14007eb5bec90c8c26eddae66acc68a1.poster.avif?t=1787390304\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/14007eb5bec90c8c26eddae66acc68a1.webm?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/14007eb5bec90c8c26eddae66acc68a1.mp4?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each mission will put your sense of strategy and stealth to the test.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Plan your operations</strong> – Choose your approach: stealthy infiltration, silent takedowns, or clever diversions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Exploit the environmen</strong>t – Hideouts, alternate routes, distractions... Each mission offers multiple solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Outsmart the enemies’ heightened senses – Sharp eyesight, acute hearing, and keen smell…</strong> Discover a whole new way to play: infiltration is no longer just about hiding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Take Control of the Untouchables</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/4cb38ade30d4d2c5d61a81939ed761fb.poster.avif?t=1787390304\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/4cb38ade30d4d2c5d61a81939ed761fb.webm?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/4cb38ade30d4d2c5d61a81939ed761fb.mp4?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of the Untouchables, take control of Eliot Ness and his team, a group of specialists with complementary skills where each member plays a key role in your infiltration operations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> – A fearless and versatile leader, able to adapt to any situation and lead even the riskiest missions to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Malone B. Clonan</strong> – A loyal right-hand man and hardened veteran who favors a more direct, forceful approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Frank E. Eager </strong>– A methodical and discreet sniper, eliminating targets with deadly precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other specialists will also join your team to help refine your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Learn to harness each member's strengths and weaknesses to build unique strategies and strike the mob where they least expect it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltrate Iconic Locations</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/b7b2c4c2f93fc0cb560f535aa41ab623.poster.avif?t=1787390304\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/b7b2c4c2f93fc0cb560f535aa41ab623.webm?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/b7b2c4c2f93fc0cb560f535aa41ab623.mp4?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission plunges you into the heart of Chicago, in places where crime and corruption thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Observe, plan, and adapt your approach to achieve your objectives without leaving a trace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>the Loop</strong>, Chicago’s iconic district and hub of corrupt power, to <strong>the mayor’s mansion</strong> where criminal alliances are forged, and <strong>the foggy Lake Michigan docks</strong>, a major hub for smuggling, each location is filled with dangers and opportunities, demanding tailored strategies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But more criminal strongholds await, where the slightest mistake could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most strategic minds will manage to infiltrate without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you operate from the shadows and bring down Al Capone’s criminal empire?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prohibeast – Tactical Infiltration at the Heart of Prohibition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Prohibeast</i></strong>, a real-time tactical infiltration game, dive into a corruption-ridden <strong>1930s Chicago</strong> plagued by smuggling and black-market meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As meat consumption is outlawed, Al Capone expands his criminal empire</strong> through a ruthless black market. Faced with widespread corruption, <strong>Eliot Ness and his team of Untouchables are ready to strike from the shadows to bring down the mob from within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltration and Strategy: Make Your Mark with Your Own Style</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/14007eb5bec90c8c26eddae66acc68a1.poster.avif?t=1787390304\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/14007eb5bec90c8c26eddae66acc68a1.webm?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/14007eb5bec90c8c26eddae66acc68a1.mp4?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each mission will put your sense of strategy and stealth to the test.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Plan your operations</strong> – Choose your approach: stealthy infiltration, silent takedowns, or clever diversions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Exploit the environmen</strong>t – Hideouts, alternate routes, distractions... Each mission offers multiple solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Outsmart the enemies’ heightened senses – Sharp eyesight, acute hearing, and keen smell…</strong> Discover a whole new way to play: infiltration is no longer just about hiding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Take Control of the Untouchables</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/4cb38ade30d4d2c5d61a81939ed761fb.poster.avif?t=1787390304\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/4cb38ade30d4d2c5d61a81939ed761fb.webm?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/4cb38ade30d4d2c5d61a81939ed761fb.mp4?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of the Untouchables, take control of Eliot Ness and his team, a group of specialists with complementary skills where each member plays a key role in your infiltration operations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Eliot Ness</strong> – A fearless and versatile leader, able to adapt to any situation and lead even the riskiest missions to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Malone B. Clonan</strong> – A loyal right-hand man and hardened veteran who favors a more direct, forceful approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ <strong>Frank E. Eager </strong>– A methodical and discreet sniper, eliminating targets with deadly precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other specialists will also join your team to help refine your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Learn to harness each member's strengths and weaknesses to build unique strategies and strike the mob where they least expect it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Infiltrate Iconic Locations</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/b7b2c4c2f93fc0cb560f535aa41ab623.poster.avif?t=1787390304\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/b7b2c4c2f93fc0cb560f535aa41ab623.webm?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/extras/b7b2c4c2f93fc0cb560f535aa41ab623.mp4?t=1787390304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission plunges you into the heart of Chicago, in places where crime and corruption thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Observe, plan, and adapt your approach to achieve your objectives without leaving a trace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>the Loop</strong>, Chicago’s iconic district and hub of corrupt power, to <strong>the mayor’s mansion</strong> where criminal alliances are forged, and <strong>the foggy Lake Michigan docks</strong>, a major hub for smuggling, each location is filled with dangers and opportunities, demanding tailored strategies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But more criminal strongholds await, where the slightest mistake could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most strategic minds will manage to infiltrate without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you operate from the shadows and bring down Al Capone’s criminal empire?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a 1930s Chicago plagued by corruption and illegal meat trafficking. In this stealth-tactics game, control Eliot Ness and his team. Exploit the environment, deceive your enemies and strike the mafia from the shadows to dismantle Al Capone's criminal empire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/dc9b4b24554f276600a69b6ab54e289c96437d95/header.jpg?t=1787390304", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/1d0c9b897decdb4a833b64d5cce9407403326c53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787390304", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503790/1d0c9b897decdb4a833b64d5cce9407403326c53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787390304", "website": "https://www.superacgames.com/produit/prohibeast/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060 | RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li